godot-e2e

The rest of this directory is NOT tracked in git. Install it from the pinned
fork commit before building/running the E2E tests (CI does this in
.github/workflows/godot-e2e.yml; locally see README "Running the standalone
E2E tests"):

    git clone https://github.com/cwchanap/godot-e2e /tmp/godot-e2e
    git -C /tmp/godot-e2e checkout 086f09d
    for root in csharp protocol runtime server; do
      rm -rf addons/gdunit_e2e/$root
      cp -a /tmp/godot-e2e/addons/gdunit_e2e/$root addons/gdunit_e2e/
    done

